    "title": "InfrastructureCoreOpenAPIModels",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Domain-neutral shared types: the unit convention, the function-data family, and the value shapes and supplemental attributes that carry no power semantics. Consumed by the data layer and the time series store, neither of which should inherit power-specific definitions."
  },
